   "headline": "KOSPI recovers from a deep drop to close higher; foreigners sell",
   "when": "Wed 4 Nov · Seoul close",
   "what": "The KOSPI opened about 2.4% higher, fell to an intraday low of 5,421.72, then closed up 0.62% at 5,683.80. Foreign investors sold a net ₩2.5 trillion, while domestic institutions and individuals bought. Samsung Electronics slipped 0.68% to ₩218,000 and SK hynix 0.14% to ₩1.4 million. The won was around 1,341.5 per dollar.",
